{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience the superhuman skill and bravery of a certified forklift operator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a well kept secret that many forklift operators are actually giraffes, now YOU can experience the thrilling life of a warehouse giraffe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you an exciting sneak peak of the upcoming forklift game Extreme Forklifting 3!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extreme Forklifting 3 is a level based, third-person driving game with some light platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your forklift to deliver pallets to their destination, build bridges and traverse dangerous obstacles, in the warehouse anything could happen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601100/extras/steam_driveby.gif?t=1742924810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo allows you to try out some of the most common forklifts and get a taste of what the full game has to offer with a few early levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo has most of the key features of the main game but is shipped with a smaller selection of levels and customization options for your forklifts and  giraffe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601100/extras/steam_girafferun.gif?t=1742924810\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601100?t=1742924810","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601100?t=1742924810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601100/9bd1678f2df63b8ee4083298ee2bb57864aece5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742924810","capsule_